title: Renaissance Round C — the board, swim lanes, and calibration hero strip
summary: 'Built the Crew Board spine + the moat-proof hero strip. The Board view (now default) renders people swim-lanes — one lane per claimant, colored to match their Team identity, header showing name·count·summed-points — plus Unclaimed/Done lanes, a LaneModeToggle (Claimant|State|Symbol, persisted), and a status/priority/search FilterBar. Above sits a default-on collapsible CalibrationStrip with an archetype×taskType CellGrid (graduated cells solid in agent-color, cold-start dimmed to ░) + a coverage StatCard. Cold-start renders honestly: all-░ grid with a ''learning in progress'' badge, all-Unclaimed board, both styled to look intentional. TaskCard+CalibrationBlock reused verbatim via normalizers. Build green, chunk 4.7→16.5kB, CLI 441.'
