learnings:
  - Reusing TaskCard+CalibrationBlock on the board via small normalizer functions (nodeToTask/unclaimedToTask) kept the card render identical across List and Board — one card definition, two data shapes. The right seam was the data, not the component.
  - 'Known thin spot: the calibration cell→board-filter click filters to empty in cold-start because board nodes carry no taskType tag to match a cell''s column. Honest given the API shape; the grid''s primary value is moat-proof, not the click-filter. Revisit when task records carry a type tag.'
  - 'Cold-start UI must be DESIGNED, not defaulted: the all-prior grid gets a ''learning in progress'' badge + dashed styling and the all-Unclaimed board is deliberate — so a brand-new project doesn''t look like the feature is broken.'
